-      CONTEXT:
-      V582 proved that roadmap parity must be an executable precondition. V583 contains fourteen tasks across an exact-planning spine, continuous self-learning, and an independent sampler branch. This task proves that the design and execution manifest are the same contract before science begins. Work at {project_root}. The planning date is {date}.
