-      EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-      - {project_root}/CODEX.md, {project_root}/CLAUDE.md, {project_root}/research-program.md, and {project_root}/openspec/change-proposals/research-roadmap-vNEXT.md
-      - {project_root}/research-roadmap.yaml and {project_root}/research-roadmap-next.yaml
