-        family_rows: family definition, parameter ranges, train/development/headline counts, and split hashes. Principle: transfer-boundary evidence.
-        instance_rows: every instance with prompt path, typed spec path, family, seed, horizon, action count, reachable-state count, and hashes. Principle: complete fixture evidence.
-        transition_rows: every reachable state-action-next-state, validity, constraints, cost, and receipt. Principle: executable dynamics evidence.
-        dynamic_programming_rows: every state-action value, optimum tie set, value-to-go, and Bellman residual. Principle: exact supervision evidence.
